{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29076","headline":"寄题华严韦秀才院 · 许浑","name":"寄题华严韦秀才院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三面楼台百丈峰，西岩高枕树重重。\n晴攀翠竹题诗滑，秋摘黄花酿酒浓。\n山殿日斜喧鸟雀，石潭波动戏鱼龙。\n今来故国遥相忆，月照千山半夜钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29076.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29076","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}